# Walking and strafing: the left stick walks the astronaut forward, back and sideways, the way the body faces.
# Needs: Earth Planet (survival, on foot, in gravity). Each leg is about one second, so the start base has room for it.
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet
# open ground: room to walk, nothing in the way
goto open
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
wait 2
# a moment's walk first: walking turns the body to the way the head faces, and goto left the body facing elsewhere
stick left 0 1
wait 0.3
stick left 0 0
wait 1

# before: with the stick at rest the astronaut stays where it is
read character
mark
wait 1
read character
expect position moved < 0.1

# the left stick forward: the astronaut walks ahead and does not turn
read character
mark
stick left 0 1
wait 1
stick left 0 0
wait 0.5
read character
expect position moved > 1.5
expect forward moved < 0.1

# the left stick back: the astronaut walks backward and still faces the same way
read character
mark
stick left 0 -1
wait 1
stick left 0 0
wait 0.5
read character
expect position moved > 1.5
expect forward moved < 0.1

# the left stick right: the astronaut sidesteps and still faces the same way
read character
mark
stick left 1 0
wait 1
stick left 0 0
wait 0.5
read character
expect position moved > 1.5
expect forward moved < 0.1

# the left stick left
read character
mark
stick left -1 0
wait 1
stick left 0 0
wait 0.5
read character
expect position moved > 1.5
expect forward moved < 0.1
